DexSwapModuleFactoryL2SequencerFork (Base mainnet)
├── when the sequencer uptime feed is Base's real Chainlink feed
│   ├── it should deploy the factory
│   ├── it should set the sequencer uptime feed
│   ├── it should set the sequencer grace period
│   └── it should set the router
├── when the sequencer uptime feed is an EOA
│   └── it should revert with DexSwapModuleFactory_SequencerFeedNotContract
├── when a module is created
│   ├── it should wire the real sequencer feed into the module
│   └── it should wire the real sequencer feed through createDeterministic
└── when the module reads the live feed
    ├── it should validate a swap while the sequencer is up
    └── it should reject the swap while the grace period has not elapsed
